      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, so the obvious alternative is:\n```\nreturn protocol.DocumentURI(path.Join(string(dir), relPath))\n```\nBut, `path.Join` does a `Clean`, so that means `file:///` would change to `file:/`\n\nAnd if you did\n```\nreturn protocol.DocumentURI(string(dir) + \"/\" + relPath)\n```\nthen you skip the %-encoding, which is kinda the whole point of this fix. I agree though it\u0027s not particularly nice bouncing back through filepaths.",
